ackdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cVMK2k0Wbs8DV3IK5sS4ziVenrI.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2003,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being wrongfully convicted for stealing a pair of shoes, Stanley Yelnats is sent away to Camp Green Lake, a boys detention facility where inmates are forced to dig holes all day in the hot desert sun as a form of character building. As he endures the brutal routine, Stanley begins to uncover a hidden truth behind the camp, one that connects to a dangerous secret—and possibly Stanley’s family itself.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":12609,\"title\":\"Help! I'm a Fish\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s9yFQD19xJqXEnAnUAZFUan25DJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yQ0eSp9Cfpixnp1EvFpFWQzKhB5.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three children are accidentally transformed into fish after consuming a potion made by an eccentric scientist. The kids end up in the sea, with one problem: they must find and drink the antidote within 48 hours, or forever remain as fish.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":17710,\"title\":\"Hey Arnold! The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/etxcq4qiFNi5p0q71APw8MNzPPT.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pEMcogCLU2z9s3Vl10UUKswLLk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Arnold and his friends must recover a stolen document in order to prevent the neighborhood from being bulldozed.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":50300,\"title\":\"Ed, Edd n Eddy's Big Picture Show\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uwuNrGrGJlkqInCZ9Kunf9JYWUG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zvYyXc4wfevrxDRhkdyANMqu9KD.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a scam goes horribly wrong and leaves the neighborhood kids furious, the Eds embark on a journey to find Eddy's brother in the \\\"Ed, Edd, n Eddy\\\" series finale.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Animation\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":65592,\"title\":\"Princes and Princesses\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gP1PDJmbsF5J2teuond2OtRiEaC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6W2jH4hcqbNto9uTyda8ccNj1oJ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In this episodic animated fantasy from France, an art teacher interprets a series of six fairy tales (each involving a prince or princess) with the help of two precocious students. Princes and Princesses was created using a special style of cutout animation, with black silhouetted characters performing the action against backlit backdrops in striking colors.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Animation\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":480736,\"title\":\"25 km/h\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gux7726i4VdKCGZFyeN6lL4Rvr3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/UVAmU63ORkBRVtUuT3HK0EP1BU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A road movie about two very different brothers who have not seen each other for 20 years: city manager Christian  and cabinetmaker Georg, who never left their hometown and took care of their father until his passing.  After their fathers funeral, the brothers decide on a whim, and with some help from the alcohol, to fulfil their old dream: travel trough Germany together on their mopeds.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":662745,\"title\":\"Monica and Friends: Lessons\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gzaLnQ2CctXaHqatSlRbSVp8Bh4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sPgQg5DK8GL6uCcUw9s8PuE2Y80.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the sequel to Turma da Mônica: Laços, we follow Mônica, Jimmy Five, Maggy and Smudge dealing with the consequences of a mistake made at school. At the same time, they face transformations from childhood to adolescence and are about to discover the value of friendship.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1630545,\"title\":\"Le Temps d'une Tartine 2\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/an8FGJS0YFbWENUtVrBQiboMMTp.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJzuhtmpBYeQEpmSpVlsnI6RJp8.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While Mixel tries the best he can to help along with Martin's parents, Charlène and Martin have escaped the flames and appeared somewhen else, where twists and turns won't end. Why is everything happening? To find that out... they must go Back to the Toaster!\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1245119,\"title\":\"The Yellow Tie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tkCQjcvLKG5HhvVyqkNriifLgLW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mlJoaocwe4yopxastL9ki8vKSy1.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The extraordinary life of Sergiu Celibidache, from his childhood in Romania to his exile in pursuit of a career in music, his struggle for survival in wartime Germany and his rise, fall and rise again, in an unimaginable life journey.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":843843,\"title\":\"Suddenly\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/x5Xj72BQVNzk6lREDwNuYt4FLoX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mInqo4SQCjDgN5dDIJDa52UMETl.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ben and Laura are a passionate but volatile couple who embark on a round-the-world sailing adventure to give their relationship a new start. During their trip, they decide to explore a vast deserted island which they discover off the coast of Chile. Caught in a violent storm, they shelter in an abandoned whaling station for the night but wake up the next morning to find their boat has disappeared. Stranded in a hostile environment with no means of communication, dwindling supplies and winter approaching they must work together in a life and death battle for survival, that will challenge their feelings and change their relationship forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":11866,\"title\":\"Flight of the Phoenix\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pcj6unMsKCw0ogWFlUXmbc9gKap.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mWXU29QjfjEG37d0c2hE11MWRGq.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When an oil rig in the Gobi Desert of Mongolia proves unproductive, an aircraft crew are sent to shut the operation down and fly them out. On the flight out over the desert on the way to Beijing, Capt. Frank Towns and co-pilot A.J. are unable to keep their cargo plane, a C-119 Flying Boxcar, in the air when a violent sandstorm strikes. Crash-landing in a remote uncharted part of the desert, the two pilots and their passengers -- a crew of oil workers and a drifter -- must work together to survive by rebuilding the aircraft. Soon, low supplies and a band of merciless smugglers add even greater urgency to their task.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"q35bysShewQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}